# kovanica-devnet — never commit operator secrets or runtime state.
#
# Devnet is local-only, but the same secret classes apply: a devnet operator
# still holds authority keys and a faucet wallet.

# PoA authority signing keys (32-byte Ed25519 seed, mode 0600). The matching
# `authorities.conf` is PUBLIC and stays tracked.
authority-keys/*.env

# Runtime state: ledger snapshots, replay logs, peer ban state, faucet ledgers.
data/
keys/
logs/
seeds/*/data/
seeds/*/keys/
*.log

# Any local env/secret, repo-wide.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS noise.
*.backup
*.bak
*.swp
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
